{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "main_7_level_main_07-02_end",
  "groupId": "main_7",
  "stageId": "main_07-02",
  "title": "变节之刃",
  "storyCode": "7-3",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_07-02_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "531ffc5ef01b72cdecffb04f863ba974d1a0e7a6f377ab56990de8f60eba1607",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "龙门上城区  7：20 p.m."
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "哈，哈......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "......你竟然这么坚定。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "没想到。我没想到，你......能让我流血。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "我们，哈，我们都，从来没能......走出过去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "星熊，你一直在这座城里，而我......始终不在，也一直在逃。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "我想我永远都无法忍受这座城市。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "最后还是变成了这种小打小闹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "我拦不住你了。你走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "抱歉，星熊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "我走以后，请你代我去贫民区。贫民区的居民惊魂未定，该有人代表近卫局去保护他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "如果有感染者的孩子，送你玩具小熊的话......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "收下吧。那是乌萨斯人教她们做的。因我们的失误而丧生的米莎，教她们做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "好。我会做到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "对不起。我欠你的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "我不想听你道歉。说实在的，你不适合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "星熊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "......该说都说完了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "走！别再回来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陈",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "......珍重。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "“无法忍受这座城市？”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "......有几个人比你更在乎这座城市？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "谎话精......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "星熊督察！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "......什么？督察，你，你受伤了？谁能......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "对了，我们刚刚、刚刚看见陈长官她——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "啊，那个，抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "你们有没有时间好好聊聊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫局成员",
      "speakerId": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "督察......意思是你也要妨碍公务哈？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "星熊",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "text": "......也不能这么说吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "出去吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_038",
      "text": "是，魏公。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "我说过......别再那么称呼我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_038",
      "text": "是。随时听候您的吩咐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "凯尔希小姐和阿米娅妹妹，在你们说话前，我能先和他说上两句吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "嗯，您说吧，文月小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "请便。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "我们相处很多年了，魏彦吾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "为什么说这个——为什么是现在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "我可是能从你眼睛里看出你在想什么的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "......文月。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "哎，哎。我向来都看得出。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "我知道龙门对你来说是你的一切，你的心血你的梦想。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "不，文月......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "但今天这一切不是你想要的吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "啊，（东国语道歉）。我不是在说我们进退两难的处境。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "我说的是......你这拿自己一切换来的繁荣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "你已经失去两位亲人了。不，用你的话说，三位，甚至是十几位。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "现在你总不会还想让自己的侄女也死在那吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "她痛恨影卫们。一旦让他们去抓陈，她只会拼死反抗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "不，魏彦吾......我也不是在说这个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "你不后悔吗？你要让她们两个全都死在异国的城市吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "感染者又怎么了？成了感染者，她们就不是你的侄女了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "如果我们有了孩子，难道也会被你这样对待......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "我所做的一切都是为了让这片土地能够变得更好，也从没要陈晖洁去做该我做的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "但她就是这个性子！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "不，对她隐瞒，只是在她的心上继续割肉而已。她只会觉得自己不属于这里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "你期望她去做的那些事情，太遥远了，太难了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "那我能够停手吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "我身后的这些人，我脚下的这座城，我与他们角力了那么久，却也只能搏到这种结果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "......龙门能允许我停手吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "是她想要这么做，是她想要正本清源，是她想要这座城邦不再是我治下的模样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "我只是教她如果那么做，需要些什么，又要放弃什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "行了，行了。还解释些什么，耳朵都起茧子了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "我去把她抓回来。我可不能看着她去送死。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "你做不了的事，我来做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "荒唐！不许......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "我已经拟好了方案。我会把她带回来，而你，文月，你不准走出这里一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "嚯，你要拦我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "（东国语）？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "唔哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "啊？医生，文月小姐刚说了什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "如果不是她提，我都快不记得东国有这么粗鲁的词汇了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "魏彦吾，是不是忘了我是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "文月，我有底线。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "你还记不记得自己是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "文月......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......医生，我觉得......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（魏彦吾先生，是不是非常在乎文月小姐？）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "（对文月来说亦然。也许......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "好了，罗德岛的二位。请罗德岛帮助龙门城和小陈，要多少钱？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "我来出这个钱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "文月小姐真要这样委托吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "要的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "虽然这么说不大好，但我家这位今天确实不在状态。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "或者说，对方的计谋实在是有点出乎我们意料，把他看重的东西全算计到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "对方不仅了解龙门，还非常了解他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "文月，不可再多言！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "你管我？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "医生，开价吧。我付得起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "文月小姐所说，我已经听懂了。钱不是必要的，只是二位现在，能不能稍稍听我说两句？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "......医生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "也许我不该在这时候进言。但恕我直言，龙门需要一些外力的帮助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "文月小姐，我可以继续说下去吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "你说吧。我可没有管别人说什么的习惯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "......荒唐......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "罗德岛只是一家制药公司。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "只是，这片大地的形势不允许任何人逍遥自在，何况是在市场、人事、政治倾向和国家利益中，均可能树敌无数的制药公司。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "在各个国家的夹缝间游走，对于我们而言，也是无奈之举。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "当我们面对各个势力施加给我们的巨大压力时，我们需要自己独特的制衡手段......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "不过，这些手段起效的前提是——这些出谋划策者的大脑中，切实还残留着哪怕一丝理智。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "所以，在特殊状况随时都会发生的今日，我们罗德岛也必须准备好相应的对策。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "说重点。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我有一个建议。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "希望你的建议确实有用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "魏先生，我不知道该不该向您透露这些信息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "请您相信，凭龙门的实力与魏先生的本领，想消灭罗德岛只需要一个眼神。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我们的设备再先进，也没办法和魏先生手下的队伍相提并论。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "如果忤逆您的意思，罗德岛一定血流成河。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "请说。你与阿米娅小姐大可放心，我没有余力再去针对罗德岛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "所以，没什么好忌讳的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "在我们与魏先生第一次交流时，魏先生也对我们拥有的武装力量十分好奇。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "现在我可以坦白：就像刚才我说的那样，在这方面，罗德岛根本不配与龙门比较。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "只是，无论是多强的武装力量都会被局势束缚，之间的区别，仅在于程度不一而同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "即使是您的队伍，被人捆住手脚也一样无处发挥。哪怕是您亲自上阵，对方依然有办法拿到你的把柄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "事实上，我的同僚曾在一场筹款晚会上遇见过科西切公爵与她的养女。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "不是人口买卖的会场，也并非纵欲狂欢的贵族娱乐。那一次晚会上出席的所有人，都代表着不同的诉求和权力实体。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "......继续。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "接下来的事情你应该已经有所预见，魏先生。那一次的晚会上，许多优秀的青年人凭他们的理论和构想，获得了他们应得的价码——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "但塔露拉没有。也正是如此，我与我的同僚都没有想到，这个少女会成长为今天的整合运动领袖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "事实上......我们早该想到，因为科西切公爵只在必要的场合出现，只做必要的事，除此之外，无声无息。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "科西切不会展示自身的力量换取协助，塔露拉也没有。之间的关联，魏先生比我们更清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "科西切公爵并没有把她当作奴隶或是人质。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "她是他的继承人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "凯尔希医生，你的见闻佐证了我的想法。塔露拉是科西切的继承人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "没错，魏先生......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "科西切公爵知道你有什么，也知道你能做什么。塔露拉也一样能。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "请将这件事交给我们，魏先生。我们是最适合去解决本次事件的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "就像阿米娅之前说的那样，罗德岛与龙门间的正式合作已经结束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "现在，罗德岛的舰船已经离开了龙门接舷区。罗德岛离开龙门之后发生的事，与龙门毫无关联。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "阿米娅，可以吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......没错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "魏先生。我们......并不那么关心龙门城的未来和你的私事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "但阴谋家利用感染者引发的事件，它带来的那些后果是我们拼尽全力去避免的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "如果魏先生允许，并且能给出承诺，承诺你不会使用任何武力攻击我们的话——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "之后的战斗，就会是我们罗德岛的战斗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "我不依靠感染者，也不相信感染者。你们与整合运动的区别，在我看来，只是你们还没与龙门敌对，仅此而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "整合运动之前又是怎么样的面貌？就算我们不记得，却有人记得。他们本不是现在这副模样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "言语可以修饰，意图可以伪装，整合运动再怎么吹嘘自己是改变感染者处境的力量，如今还是成了乌萨斯的炮灰。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "此事之后，乌萨斯将会轻松地扑灭整合运动的火。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "你们会不会是另一个整合运动？谁能证明，谁能证伪？你们会在什么时候背叛，又会在哪里对我们亮出獠牙？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "以及，我并不相信你们有解决科西切继承人的实力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "那是科西切公爵......与他为敌且获胜的，这么多年来也只有龙门而已。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "魏先生，你打算自己带领武装力量，袭击切尔诺伯格核心城，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "不要妄加猜测。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "方才，魏先生——你的观点已经透露了你更深层次的想法。你认为只有你自己能做到这件事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "确实，龙门有这个实力，你也有战胜乌萨斯阴谋的经验。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "而且这一次，你还打算用自己的死来抵消龙门宣战的罪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "如文月小姐所说，你觉得自己做了许多违心的事，你打算用死亡一劳永逸地偿还所有过错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "我一生犯错无数，死亡并不足以偿还，也不知向谁偿还。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "即使如此，魏先生，你能保证在你死后，真的不会有人迁怒于你吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "龙门是大炎要地，我既保下了它，它的繁荣就依然能延续。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我说的是，文月夫人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "（凯尔希医生......好直白！）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "医生？！说什么呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "没错，魏先生。我害怕尊夫人会因为你而受到伤害。就算你死了，她也依然是你的遗孀。你知道的事，尊夫人基本上也都知道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "既然有人能迫使你做出违背意愿的事情，我想，会做这样的事情......也很正常。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "似乎那位也不是个心思开阔豁达的人吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "够了，真的够了医生！你说的实在太过分了，我不要......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "所以，你认为即使我出手，也同样保不下文月。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "可能并不只是文月小姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "......我大可一同去，不就是死......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "文月！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "唉哟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "说吧，凯尔希医生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "为了你珍视的城市......以及真正珍视的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我恳求你，魏大人。把这件事情交给真正的专家。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "也许和任何势力为敌我们都毫无胜算，但感染者，我们确实知根知底。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我们知道他们想要什么，也知道他们不想要什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "只有感染者才能对抗感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "那么，你想要什么？罗德岛的领袖，以及罗德岛的医生？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "你们不是来这里做慈善的。进攻核心城不仅是以卵击石，它一定会令你们损失惨重，更可能是徒劳无功。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "魏先生很清楚现状。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "到了这一步，双方都说实话，会更符合我们的利益需求。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我们不仅需要魏先生同意我们的作战。我们还需要魏先生的承诺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "即使在未来，魏先生你可能会变卦......我们也想要承诺。对现在的承诺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "因为我相信龙门和您的家庭，以及陈长官，值得一个承诺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "文月小姐，我们不需要您支付金钱。因为您的善良，您对感染者的态度，值得我们去执行一次无需回报的公正任务。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "（小兔子......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "文月",
      "speakerId": "char_2006_weiywfmzuki",
      "text": "（比大拇指）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......？？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "我同意。在龙门-切尔诺伯格事件结束之前，我们龙门绝不会再干涉任何罗德岛的事务。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "以及，在我看来，医生似乎欲言又止。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "说吧。你说什么，我都暂时能够承受。毕竟我也想请罗德岛帮我救助一位感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "......那么，我还有一个提议。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "魏彦吾",
      "speakerId": "char_2005_weiyw",
      "text": "有什么价码，尽管开。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "二十年前，爱德华·雅特利亚斯，也就是塔露拉·雅特利亚斯之父，死在了龙门。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凯尔希",
      "speakerId": "char_003_kalts",
      "text": "我希望魏先生能把他的遗物借给我们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
